hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"64","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main qabr ke azab se, jahannam ke azab se, zindagi-maut ke fitne se aur Masih Dajjal ke fitne ke shar se teri panah chahta hun. [Salam pherne se pehle namaz mein padhe]"
"65","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main qabr ke azab se teri panah chahta hun; Masih Dajjal ke fitne se teri panah chahta hun; zindagi-maut ke fitne se teri panah chahta hun. Ae Allah! Main gunah aur qarz se teri panah chahta hun."
"66","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main ne apni jaan par bahut zulm kiya; tere siwa gunah koi nahin bakhshta; apni taraf se maghfirat se mujhe bakhsh de aur mujh par raham kar; beshak Tu hi bahut bakhshne wala, nihayat raham wala hai."
"67","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main ne jo kiya aur jo muakhkhar kiya, jo chhipaya aur jo zahir kiya, jo zyadati ki aur jo Tu mujhse behtar janta hai [woh] bakhsh de; Tu hi muqaddam karne wala hai, Tu hi muakhkhar karne wala hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin."
"68","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tere zikr mein, tere shukr mein aur khubsurat ibadat mein meri madad farma. [Har farz namaz ke baad padhe]"
"69","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main bukhl se teri panah chahta hun, buzdili se teri panah chahta hun, zaleeltareen umr ki taraf lautae jaane se teri panah chahta hun; duniya ke fitne aur qabr ke azab se teri panah chahta hun."
"70","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main Tujhse jannat mangta hun aur aag se teri panah chahta hun."
"71","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Ghaib ke ilm aur makhluq par qudrat ke waste—mere liye zindagi behtar jante hue mujhe zinda rakh, maut behtar jante hue mujhe maut de. Ae Allah! Chhipe-khule mein tera darr mangta hun; raza-ghazab mein haqq baat mangta hun; ghina-faqr mein miyanarwi mangta hun; na khatm hone wali nemat mangta hun; na tutne wali aankhon ki thandak mangta hun; faisle ke baad raza mangta hun; maut ke baad aaramdeh zindagi mangta hun; nuqsandeh takleef aur gumrahkun fitne ke baghair tere chehre ke deedar ki lazzat aur teri mulaqat ka shauq mangta hun. Ae Allah! Hamein iman ke zewar se aarasta kar aur hamein hidayatyafta hadi bana."
"72","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main Tujhse mangta hun—Tu hi ek, yakta, beniyaz hai; jis ne na jana, na jana gaya, jis ka koi hamsar nahin—mere gunah bakhsh de; beshak Tu hi bahut bakhshne wala, nihayat raham wala hai."
"73","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main Tujhse mangta hun—tareef teri hi hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin, akela, beshareek; bahut ehsan karne wala, aasmanon-zameen ka paida karne wala, jalal wa ikram wala!"
"74","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main Tujhse mangta hun—main gawahi deta hun ke Tu hi Allah hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin, ek, beniyaz; jis ne na jana, na jana gaya, jis ka koi hamsar nahin."
